  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Leo has a paper face. \"Mia, look at me,\" says Leo. \"I have two eyes.\" \"I have two ears.\" \"What am I?\" \"Is it a mouse?\" asks Mia. \"No, it isn't.\"",
      "\"I have a long tail.\" \"Are you a cat?\" \"No, I am not.\" \"I like bananas.\" \"Are you a monkey?\" \"Yes, I am!\"",
      "Leo smiles. \"Now you draw,\" says Leo. Mia draws a funny face. It has big ears. It has one big eye. \"Is it Pip?\" asks Leo. \"Yes, it is!\" Pip says, \"Woof!\""
    ],
